sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant E as WAF and load balancer
    participant A as API task
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    C->>E: POST /api/v1/accounts/{id}/withdrawals<br/>Bearer token, Idempotency-Key
    E->>A: forward over the private network
    A->>A: verify token signature, issuer, expiry<br/>require accounts.write scope, validate body
    A->>D: BEGIN, lock the account row
    A->>D: look up the idempotency key
    A->>D: sum today's withdrawals and payment holds
    alt within the daily limit and the balance
        A->>D: update balance, insert ledger entry, COMMIT
        A-->>C: 201 Created with the transaction
    else limit exceeded
        A->>D: ROLLBACK
        A-->>C: 422 DAILY_WITHDRAWAL_LIMIT_EXCEEDED<br/>"Please contact the bank for assistance."
    end
